IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDEC3-WARP.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 WARPS-PER-SM        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THREAD-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDEC3.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF WARPS-PER-SM == 0
        MOVE 32 TO WARPS-PER-SM.
    END-IF.

    MOVE SEQ-LEN TO THREAD-BLOCKS.
    DIVIDE 128 INTO THREAD-BLOCKS.
    MULTIPLY NUM-HEADS BY THREAD-BLOCKS.
    DIVIDE WARPS-PER-SM INTO THREAD-BLOCKS.
    IF THREAD-BLOCKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO THREAD-BLOCKS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 THREAD-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-HEADS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
